 a drawer. Supports composable rows, selection modes, and nested submenus."},"921":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-1","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Features"},"922":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-2","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#installation","content":"Installation"},"923":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-3","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"Examples"},"924":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-4","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"925":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-5","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"926":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-6","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"ARIA"},"927":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-7","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"928":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-8","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#props","content":"Props"},"929":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-9","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menu","content":"Menu"},"930":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-10","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menutrigger","content":"MenuTrigger"},"931":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-11","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menugroup","content":"MenuGroup"},"932":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-12","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menuitem","content":"MenuItem"},"933":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-13","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#separator","content":"Separator"},"934":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-14","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#submenutrigger","content":"SubmenuTrigger"},"935":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-15","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu","content":"`MenuTrigger` wraps a trigger element and a `Popover` containing `Menu`. The menu is fully keyboard-navigable, supports typeahead search, and handles open/close state automatically. The trigger applies `hideArrow` and card styling to all popovers, including nested submenus."},"936":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-16","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Trigger and popover**: `MenuTrigger` wraps any trigger and opens a `Popover` with automatic card styling and hidden arrow. Use for desktop; use `Drawer` for mobile."},"937":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-17","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Menu title and groups**: Place an optional `Heading` as a sibling to `Menu` (not `slot=\"title\"`). Use `MenuGroup` + `Header` + `Heading` for section labels; group headings are presentational."},"938":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-18","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Composable rows**: Each `MenuItem` renders a string label or composed content (icons, checkboxes). Use render props (`isSelected`, `selectionMode`) and pass `textValue` for typeahead."},"939":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-19","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"` on `Menu` or per-`MenuGroup`. Use controlled state or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled menus."},"940":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-20","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Separators and submenus**: `Separator` divides items. `SubmenuTrigger` nests a `Popover` + `Menu` for hierarchies."},"941":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-21","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"**Popover or drawer**: Open from `MenuTrigger` for positioned overlays, or place `Menu` in a `Drawer` for full-screen/mobile."},"942":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-22","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from"},"943":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-23","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from"},"944":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-24","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories fr"},"945":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-25","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from '"},"946":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-26","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key               | Action                     |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `Enter` / `Space` | Activates the focused item |","table":"table-0"},"947":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-27","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key                 | Action                    |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `Arrow Up` / `Down` | Moves focus between items |","table":"table-0"},"948":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-28","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key            | Action                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Home` / `End` | Jumps to the first or last item |","table":"table-0"},"949":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-29","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key           | Action                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `Arrow Right` | Opens the submenu (if present) |","table":"table-0"},"950":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-30","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key          | Action                               |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Arrow Left` | Closes the submenu and returns focus |","table":"table-0"},"951":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-31","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key      | Action                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `Escape` | Closes the menu (or submenu) |","table":"table-0"},"952":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-32","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#keyboard","content":"| Key                 | Action                                      |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Typeahead (letters) | Jumps to the item matching the typed letter |","table":"table-0"},"953":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-33","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Menu accessible name**: Set `aria-label` on the `<Menu>` to name the list (e.g., \"Actions\", \"Share with\"). This is separate from any `Heading` title in the popover."},"954":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-34","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Roles**: Single-select items use `menuitemradio`; multiple-select use `menuitemcheckbox`. Unselectable items use `menuitem`."},"955":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-35","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Selection indicators are decorative**: A checkbox, radio check, or chevron-right icon is purely visual. The item owns the `aria-checked` state."},"956":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-36","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Group headings**: The group `Heading` receives `role=\"presentation\"` automatically and acts as a label for the group, not a real heading level."},"957":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-37","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Title placement**: Place an optional `Heading` as a sibling to `Menu`, not wrapped inside (do not use `slot=\"title\"`; see \"Title and groups\" example)."},"958":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-38","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Menu name**: Set `aria-label` on `<Menu>` to name the list (\"Actions\", \"Share with\", \"Theme\")."},"959":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-39","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Stable IDs**: Give each `MenuItem` a unique `id` for React tracking across re-renders."},"960":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-40","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Typeahead**: For composed labels (icons, checkboxes), provide `textValue` to `MenuItem` for typeahead search."},"961":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-41","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Selection modes**: Set `selectionMode` on `Menu` (all items) or per-`MenuGroup` (only group). Use controlled state for tracking."},"962":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-42","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Submenus**: Use `SubmenuTrigger` with `chevron-right` icon. Keyboard navigation is automatic."},"963":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-43","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Mobile**: Replace `MenuTrigger` + `Popover` with `Drawer` on narrow viewports; reuse the same `Menu`."},"964":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-44","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Avoid complex content**: Forms, date pickers, and multi-line content belong in a separate overlay, not in menu items."},"965":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"page","content":"MetricsLockup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup"},"966":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-0","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","content":"The MetricsLockup component displays a single metric with an optional title, info tooltip, trend indicator, and description."},"967":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-1","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup#installation","content":"In