ost layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[746,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[741,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[216,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[247,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1658,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[954,"**Roles**: Single-select items use `menuitemradio`; multiple-select use `menuitemcheckbox`. Unselectable items use `menuitem`."],[221,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[245,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[242,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1304,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1305,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[955,"**Selection indicators are decorative**: A checkbox, radio check, or chevron-right icon is purely visual. The item owns the `aria-checked` state."],[961,"**Selection modes**: Set `selectionMode` on `Menu` (all items) or per-`MenuGroup` (only group). Use controlled state for tracking."],[940,"**Separators and submenus**: `Separator` divides items. `SubmenuTrigger` nests a `Popover` + `Menu` for hierarchies."],[1396,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[377,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to t