d's press behavior."],[868,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[722,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[890,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[508,"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."],[792,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[815,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[845,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[916,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[844,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[935,"`MenuTrigger` wraps a trigger element and a `Popover` containing `Menu`. The menu is fully keyboard-navigable, supports typeahead search, and handles open/close state automatically. The trigger applies `hideArrow` and card styling to all popovers, including nested submenus."],[151,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[998,"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."],[1138,"`orientation` switches between `horizontal` (accent bar on top) and `vertical` (accent bar on the leading edge)."],[1484,"`overflowLabels` is optional and defaults to \"Previous tabs\" and \"Next tabs\". Provide localized labels 